Version: 0.67-1jammy
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-pil, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.8.0), gsettings-desktop-schemas, pyserial | python3-serial
Recommends: libcairo2-dev, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Installed-Size: 5000
Maintainer: wiczajac666 <OpenConsult@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: OpenConsult - Nissan CONSULT-I Diagnostic Tool for Linux
 This is an open-source diagnostic tool that interfaces with Nissan vehicle ECU systems using the CONSULT-I protocol over serial connections (USB or Bluetooth).
 Features include:
 * Real-time sensor monitoring and dashboard display
 * Live data visualization graphs
 * DTC (Diagnostic Trouble Code) reading and clearing
 * Multi-ECU support for various Nissan models
 * Dark mode UI theme with GTK4 modern design
 Platform Compatibility: Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (focal), Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (jammy), Ubuntu 26.04 LTS
